y":"apache-2.0","name":"Apache License 2.0","spdx_id":"Apache-2.0","url":"https://api.github.com/licenses/apache-2.0","node_id":"MDc6TGljZW5zZTI="},"allow_forking":true,"is_template":false,"web_commit_signoff_required":false,"has_pull_requests":true,"pull_request_creation_policy":"all","topics":["airflow","apache","apache-airflow","automation","dag","data-engineering","data-integration","data-orchestrator","data-pipelines","data-science","elt","etl","machine-learning","mlops","orchestration","python","scheduler","workflow","workflow-engine","workflow-orchestration"],"visibility":"public","forks":18214,"open_issues":1927,"watchers":47308,"default_branch":"main","permissions":{"admin":false,"maintain":false,"push":false,"triage":false,"pull":true}},"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/airflow/pulls/74561","html_url":"https://github.com/apache/airflow/pull/74561","diff_url":"https://github.com/apache/airflow/pull/74561.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/apache/airflow/pull/74561.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"### Description\n\nIn `AppflowHook._log_execution_description`, the hook previously queried `DescribeFlowExecutionRecords` once without specifying `maxResults` (defaulting to 20) and without handling `nextToken`.\n\nBecause AppFlow returns execution records in batches, a recently completed flow execution might not be included in the first page of 20 results. In such cases, attempting to look up `last_execs[execution_id]` resulted in an unhandled `KeyError`, crashing an otherwise successful flow execution.\n\nThis change:\n1. Paginates through `DescribeFlowExecutionRecords` with `maxResults=100` until the target `execution_id` is found.\n2. If the execution record is not found after inspecting all pages, logs a warning instead of raising `KeyError`, preventing a logging helper from failing the entire task.\n3. Sets `maxResults=100` in the waiter arguments inside `run_flow` to examine up to 100 records per attempt instead of 20.\n4. Adds unit tests covering single-page retrieval, multi-page pagination with `nextToken`, and graceful warning handling when an execution is missing.\n\ncloses: #72769\n\n---\n\n##### Was generative AI tooling used to co-author this PR?\n\n- [x] Yes (Antigravity)\n\n<!--\nGenerated-by: Antigravity following [the guidelines](https://github.com/apache/airflow/blob/main/contributing-docs/05_pull_requests.rst#gen-ai-assisted-contributions)\n-->","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/airflow/issues/74561/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/airflow/issues/74561/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}},"event":"cross-referenced"}]]
